# Product-naming allowlist (shim paths only). Format: path-glob<TAB>regex
# Approved customer-facing name: Metrum AI Bench CLI.
# Binary/crate names remain metrum-ai-bench-cli. Exceptions below cover legacy shims.
Cargo.toml	name = "metrumbench|path = "src/bin/metrumbench
src/bin/metrumbench*	.
README.md	metrumbench-\*|deprecated `metrumbench|shim will be removed|removed in 1\.3\.0
docs/**	metrumbench-\*|shim will be removed|removed in 1\.3\.0|deprecated shim|removed in v2\.0
external-docs/**	metrumbench-\*|shim will be removed|removed in 1\.3\.0|deprecated shim|deprecated `metrumbench|aliases remain
.gitignore	metrumbench-imagegen-artifacts
scripts/live/**	metrumbench
TRADEMARKS.md	^\*\*Forbidden\*\* \(non-exhaustive\): `MetrumBench`, `Insights CLI`, `Bench by Metrum`\.$
docs/NAMING.md	^\| Formal \| `Metrum AI Bench CLI` \| `MetrumBench`, `Insights CLI`, `Bench by Metrum` \|$
docs/NAMING.md	^\| Binary \| `metrum-ai-bench-cli` \| `metrumbench` as the primary product binary name in new docs \|$
Cargo.toml	name = "metrum-ai-bench"|path = "src/bin/metrum-ai-bench
src/bin/metrum-ai-bench.rs	.
src/bin/metrum-ai-bench-*.rs	.
src/record.rs	metrum-ai-bench\.(request|summary)\.v
README.md	deprecated `metrum-ai-bench|metrum-ai-bench\*` binary|removed in 1\.3\.0
docs/**	metrum-ai-bench\*|pre-1\.2\.0|yanked|incorrectly named
external-docs/**	metrum-ai-bench\*|yanked|pre-1\.2\.0|deprecated shims keep
CHANGELOG.md	metrum-ai-bench
